                "description": "DeltanaCL308ILC, Interconnect Grade 2 Lock - The Deltana made Interconnect Grade 2 Lock features a simple square shape. The Interconnected Handleset allows you to simply turn the interior lever to open the door without having to unlock the deadbolt. Good for doors with backset of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches with removable faceplates with an adjustable door thickness for 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches.",
